{"content": "<style>\n.sr-collection{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 0 40px;color:#1f1d1a;\n font-family:Georgia,\"Times New Roman\",\"Songti SC\",\"Noto Serif SC\",serif;line-height:1.85}\n.sr-collection h1{font-family:\"Ma Shan Zheng\",\"Songti SC\",serif;font-size:34px;\n letter-spacing:4px;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:400}\n.sr-collection .sub{color:#5a554c;margin:0 0 6px;font-size:15px}\n.sr-collection .rule{height:1px;background:#e3ddd0;margin:24px 0 30px}\n.sr-collection .lead{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ddd0;border-left:3px solid #9e2b25;\n border-radius:6px;padding:16px 20px;margin:0 0 36px;font-size:15.5px}\n.sr-collection .lead b{color:#9e2b25}\n.sr-collection h2{font-family:\"Ma Shan Zheng\",\"Songti SC\",serif;font-size:23px;font-weight:400;\n letter-spacing:2px;margin:40px 0 6px}\n.sr-collection h2+.price{color:#9e2b25;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 14px;letter-spacing:1px}\n.sr-collection p{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15.5px}\n.sr-collection .shots{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));\n gap:14px;margin:18px 0 6px;list-style:none;padding:0;justify-content:center}\n.sr-collection .shots li{margin:0}\n.sr-collection .shots.one{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,320px);justify-content:center}\n.sr-collection .shots img{width:100%;display:block;border:1px solid #e3ddd0;border-radius:4px}\n.sr-collection .shots span{display:block;font-size:13.5px;color:#6b6559;margin-top:8px;text-align:center}\n.sr-collection .cta{display:inline-block;background:#9e2b25;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;\n padding:13px 30px;border-radius:3px;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;margin:6px 0 10px}\n.sr-collection .cta:hover{background:#86241f}\n.sr-collection .cta.cta-minor{background:#fff;color:#9e2b25;border:1px solid #9e2b25;padding:11px 24px;font-size:15px}\n.sr-collection .cta.cta-minor:hover{background:#f6f1e6}\n.sr-collection .note{font-size:14.5px;color:#6b6559;line-height:1.95}\n.sr-collection .fine{margin-top:40px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #e3ddd0;\n font-size:13.5px;color:#6b6559;line-height:1.95}\n@media (max-width:640px){.sr-collection h1{font-size:27px}.sr-collection h2{font-size:20px}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"sr-collection\">\n<h1>藏品</h1>\n<p class=\"sub\">把五千年，做成能放在手边的东西</p>\n<div class=\"rule\"></div>\n<div class=\"lead\">\n  <b>三条线：朝代 · 人物 · 典集。</b>\n  朝代 + 百家姓两套手机壁纸免费领；桌面横版即将开售，留个邮箱开售时通知你。\n</div>\n\n<h2>朝代</h2>\n<p class=\"price\">单朝 ¥12 ｜ 四辑各 ¥39 ｜ 四辑全收 ¥128 ｜ 首发早鸟 ¥98</p>\n<p>从三皇五帝到觉醒年代，十六朝，朝朝一句原句、一件文物。按历史分期成四辑 —— 上古 · 帝国 · 盛衰 · 近世。手机竖版免费领；桌面横版分 1x 与 4K 两档，宣纸底、朱砂点睛，每朝的底纹，都取自那一朝的典籍与传说。</p>\n<ul class=\"shots\">\n<li><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/sanhuang-site.jpg\" alt=\"三皇五帝 · 龙马负河图\"><span>三皇五帝 · 龙马负河图</span></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/xia-site.jpg\" alt=\"夏 · 灵龟负洛书\"><span>夏 · 灵龟负洛书</span></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/shang-site.jpg\" alt=\"商 · 玄鸟\"><span>商 · 玄鸟</span></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/zhou-site.jpg\" alt=\"周 · 凤凰\"><span>周 · 凤凰</span></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/qin-site.jpg\" alt=\"秦 · 黑龙\"><span>秦 · 黑龙</span></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/han-site.jpg\" alt=\"汉 · 白虎\"><span>汉 · 白虎</span></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/sanguo-site.jpg\" alt=\"三国 · 洛神宓妃\"><span>三国 · 洛神宓妃</span></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/jin-site.jpg\" alt=\"两晋南北朝 · 白鹅\"><span>两晋南北朝 · 白鹅</span></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/sui-site.jpg\" alt=\"隋 · 龙舸\"><span>隋 · 龙舸</span></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/tang-site.jpg\" alt=\"唐 · 贡狮\"><span>唐 · 贡狮</span></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/wudai-site.jpg\" alt=\"五代十国 · 摩羯鱼龙\"><span>五代十国 · 摩羯鱼龙</span></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/song-site.jpg\" alt=\"宋 · 瑞鹤\"><span>宋 · 瑞鹤</span></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/yuan-site.jpg\" alt=\"元 · 六月飞雪\"><span>元 · 六月飞雪</span></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/ming-site.jpg\" alt=\"明 · 麒麟\"><span>明 · 麒麟</span></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/qing-site.jpg\" alt=\"清 · 甪端\"><span>清 · 甪端</span></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/juexing-site.jpg\" alt=\"觉醒年代 · 铅字\"><span>觉醒年代 · 铅字</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a class=\"cta\" href=\"/collection/dynasty/\">进入朝代专栏 →</a></p>\n\n<h2>人物</h2>\n<p class=\"price\">《百家姓》里，找到你的姓</p>\n<p>首批 100 个常见姓。一个字四种书体并列，配该姓代表人物与源流；以后扩到全部 504 姓，并做复姓。</p>\n<ul class=\"shots\">\n<li><img src=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/zhao-site.jpg\" alt=\"赵 · 四体与赵武灵王\"><span>赵 · 四体与赵武灵王</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"note\">100 姓的四体壁纸已全部做好（碑刻 · 隶书 · 行书 · 草书），留邮箱就能领。带人物底纹那一版正在逐一配 —— 每一姓画一位该姓代表人物，做好后同样送。</p>\n\n<h2>典集</h2>\n<p class=\"price\">五千年长卷 · 电子典集</p>\n<p>已写 9.5 万字的十六朝正文，做成可以躺着读的电子典集。</p>\n<p class=\"note\">正在准备中。</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"signup\">留个邮箱，两套壁纸发你</h2>\n<p class=\"sr-form-intro\">两套，共 232 张原图，直接发到你邮箱：朝代 16 朝 × iPhone / Android = 32 张；百家姓 100 姓 × iPhone / Android = 200 张。桌面横版开售时也第一时间告诉你，并给你一个名单专享价。只发这两类消息，不做群发广告，随时可退订。</p>\n\n  \n\n<style>\n#mlb2-46577392.ml-form-embedContainer{box-sizing:border-box;display:table;margin:0 auto;position:static;width:100%!important}\n#mlb2-46577392 h4,#mlb2-46577392 p,#mlb2-46577392 span,#mlb2-46577392 button{text-transform:none!important;letter-spacing:normal!important}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-embedWrapper{background:transparent;border:0;border-radius:4px;box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block!important;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-embedWrapper.embedForm{max-width:520px;width:100%}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-align-center{text-align:center}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-embedBody,#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-successBody{padding:14px 0 0}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-successContent{text-align:center;margin:0 0 20px}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-successContent h4{color:#1f1d1a;font-family:inherit;font-size:22px;font-weight:400;margin:0 0 8px}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-successContent p{color:#6b6559;font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:0}\n#mlb2-46577392 form{margin:0;width:100%}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-formContent{margin:0 0 14px;width:100%}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-fieldRow{margin:0;width:100%}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-fieldRow input{background:#fff!important;color:#333!important;border:1px solid #d8d2c4!important;border-radius:4px!important;font-family:inherit!important;font-size:14px!important;line-height:21px!important;padding:10px 12px!important;width:100%!important;box-sizing:border-box!important;text-align:center}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-embedSubmit{margin:0 0 14px;width:100%}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-embedSubmit button{background:#9e2b25!important;border:0!important;border-radius:3px!important;color:#fff!important;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit!important;font-size:14px!important;font-weight:700!important;line-height:21px!important;padding:10px!important;width:100%!important;box-sizing:border-box!important;letter-spacing:2px}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-embedSubmit button:hover{background:#7d211d!important}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-embedSubmit button.loading{display:none}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-embedPermissions{text-align:center;width:100%}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-embedPermissionsContent p{color:#6b6559;font-family:inherit;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;margin:0}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-embedPermissionsContent p a{color:#6b6559}\n.ml-error input{border-color:#b0201f!important}\n@media only screen and (max-width:400px){#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-embedWrapper.embedForm{width:100%!important}}\n</style>\n<style id=\"sr-form-fit\">\n/* 2026-10-02：让 MailerLite 表单与本站在版式上一致。\n   原嵌入自带 letter-spacing:normal!important，会把本站的字距冲掉；\n   按钮也是它自己的饱和红全宽块 —— 与本站\"朱砂点眼\"的做法不一路。 */\n#mlb2-46577392{max-width:520px;margin:0 auto!important}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-embedWrapper.embedForm{max-width:520px}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-embedBody{padding:4px 0 0}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-formContent{margin:0 0 10px}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-fieldRow input{border:1px solid #ded7c8!important;border-radius:2px!important;\n  padding:11px 12px!important;font-size:15px!important;letter-spacing:.06em!important;\n  background:#fff!important;color:#1a1a18!important;text-align:center}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-embedSubmit{margin:0 0 12px}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-embedSubmit button{background:transparent!important;color:#b03826!important;\n  border:1px solid #b03826!important;border-radius:2px!important;font-size:15px!important;\n  letter-spacing:.2em!important;text-indent:.2em;padding:11px 0!important;font-family:inherit!important;\n  transition:background .2s,color .2s}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-embedSubmit button:hover{background:#b03826!important;color:#fff!important}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-embedPermissionsContent p,\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-successContent p{letter-spacing:.04em!important;color:#6b675f!important}\n#mlb2-46577392 .ml-form-embedPermissionsContent a{color:#8c8578!important}\n.sr-form-intro{max-width:580px;margin:0 auto 20px!important;line-height:2.1;color:#6b675f;\n  letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:15px;text-align:center}\n</style>\n<div id=\"mlb2-46577392\" class=\"ml-form-embedContainer ml-subscribe-form ml-subscribe-form-46577392\"><div class=\"ml-form-align-center\"><div class=\"ml-form-embedWrapper embedForm\"><div class=\"ml-form-embedBody ml-form-embedBodyDefault row-form\"><form class=\"ml-block-form\" action=\"https://assets.mailerlite.com/jsonp/2674672/forms/200094094575273632/subscribe\" data-code=\"\" method=\"post\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"ml-form-formContent\"><div class=\"ml-form-fieldRow ml-last-item\"><div class=\"ml-field-group ml-field-email ml-validate-email ml-validate-required\"><input aria-label=\"email\" aria-required=\"true\" type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" data-inputmask=\"\" name=\"fields[email]\" placeholder=\"你的邮箱地址\" autocomplete=\"email\"></div></div></div><div class=\"ml-form-embedPermissions\"><div class=\"ml-form-embedPermissionsContent default privacy-policy\"><p><span><a href=\"https://theseventhrealm.com/privacy/\">隐私政策</a></span></p></div></div><div class=\"ml-form-hidden\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"ml-submit\" value=\"1\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"anticsrf\" value=\"true\"></div><div class=\"ml-form-embedSubmit\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"primary\">留邮箱</button><button disabled=\"disabled\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"button\" class=\"loading\"><div class=\"ml-form-embedSubmitLoad\"></div><span class=\"sr-only\">Loading...</span></button></div></form></div><div class=\"ml-form-successBody row-success\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"ml-form-successContent\"><h4>已发送</h4><p>两套壁纸的下载链接已经发到你邮箱，请查收。没看到就翻一下垃圾邮件箱。<br>过几天想再要、或者一直收不到 —— 写信到 <a href=\"mailto:hello@theseventhrealm.com\" style=\"color:#b03826\">hello@theseventhrealm.com</a>，我们人工补发。</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ml-form-scripts\"><script>function ml_webform_success_46577392(){var w=document.querySelector('.ml-subscribe-form-46577392');if(!w)return;var s=w.querySelector('.row-success'),f=w.querySelector('.row-form');if(s)s.style.display='';if(f)f.style.display='none';}</script><script src=\"https://groot.mailerlite.com/js/w/webforms.min.js?v83147fa8ce2d95cb73ece7f28b469519\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script><script>fetch(\"https://assets.mailerlite.com/jsonp/2674672/forms/200094094575273632/takel\")</script></div></div>\n\n<h2>怎么拿到</h2>\n<p>填上面的表单，两套共 232 张直接发到你邮箱。没收到就翻一下垃圾邮件，或写信到 hello@theseventhrealm.com。</p>\n<div class=\"fine\">\n手机壁纸免费提供；桌面横版付款后即时交付下载链接，因数字内容可复制，除文件损坏或未交付外不支持无理由退款。<br>\n字体遵循 SIL Open Font License 1.1：衍生作品可随产品分发，字体文件本身不单独出售。<br>\n古籍原文属公有领域；本产品价值在于选、编、注与版式设计。\n</div>\n</div>\n<style id=\"qj-rhythm\">:root{ --sp-sec:clamp(30px,3.5vw,42px); --sp-para:clamp(16px,1.6vw,20px); --sp-block:clamp(24px,2.8vw,32px); --sp-head:clamp(38px,4.2vw,50px);}section{margin-block:0!important;padding:var(--sp-sec) 24px}.verse{padding:var(--sp-sec) 24px}.prose p{margin:var(--sp-para) 0}.prose h2{margin:var(--sp-head) 0 16px}.dispute{margin:var(--sp-block) auto 0}.finale{padding:0}.final-line{margin-top:0;line-height:1.5}.lone{line-height:1.7}footer{padding:56px 24px 48px}.sr-collection p{margin:0 0 16px}.sr-collection h2{margin:44px 0 8px}</style>"}